  m_Text: "\nDear Reporter,\n\nSomething happened in this village\u2014\na family
    and a child disappeared,\nbut the truth has never been revealed; instead, it
    has been buried.\n\n\nThe past event lies hidden beneath the surface,\nwith many
    details deliberately ignored or distorted.\n"
